   "etapa": "explicar",
   "piezas": [
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "〜ところだ: about to",
     "texto": [
      "To say something is about to start right now: dictionary-form verb + **ところ です**: **いま、 ちょうど でかける ところ です** (I'm just about to leave now).",
      "It goes with **ちょうど** (just) when the moment is exact."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "〜たところ: when one did it, it turned out that",
     "texto": [
      "To tell what happened when something was done: た form + **ところ**: **でんわ を かけた ところ、 でませんでした** (I called, but nobody answered). The result may be surprising, although surprise isn't required."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
